{
  "slug": "subtext",
  "name": "Subtext",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Your agent writes the code. Subtext proves it works. MCP tools for verification — persistent knowledge of your app, real-browser checks, and session replays your team can watch instead of reading diffs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `sightmap-authoring` (Use when building or maintaining a sightmap corpus — defining components, authoring .sightmap/ YAML, seeding from a live…), `sightmap-browser` (Use when driving a live browser session with a sightmap — starting or navigating a Chrome session, taking…), `subtext-privacy` (Privacy rule management — detect PII in sessions and manage element-block, URL, and network privacy rules), `subtext-review` (Review a completed Subtext session and produce a structured summary), `subtext-session` (Session replay tools for analyzing Fullstory session recordings), `subtext-setup-plugin` (Install the Subtext plugin and verify the MCP server is connected), `subtext-shared` (Foundation skill for the Subtext plugin), `subtext-sightmap` (Connect a project's .sightmap/ corpus to Subtext session review — maintain it with the bundled sightmap skills and…), and 2 more\n- **MCP servers** (2): `subtext`, `subtext-eu1`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install subtext@claude-community` from `fullstorydev/subtext`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
